        <mxCell id="nw-note16" value="&lt;b&gt;Security groups:&lt;/b&gt; ALB ← CloudFront VPC-origin only · tasks ← ALB only (:8000) · OpenSearch ← tasks only (:443) · tasks egress 443 only. &lt;b&gt;Org SCP&lt;/b&gt; pins regional services to us-east-2 and denies GuardDuty (→ ClamAV). &lt;b&gt;Prod toggles&lt;/b&gt; (Terraform, off in dev): enable_interface_endpoints · NAT per AZ · enable_network_firewall (domain allowlist for Microsoft endpoints) · multi-AZ OpenSearch with dedicated masters." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D5DBDB;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
